<h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Multi-host deployment</h1>
<p>Build-time: one codebase builds with the Node adapter (default), <code>NETLIFY=1</code> (@marko/run-adapter-netlify), <code>VERCEL=1</code> (@marko/run-adapter-vercel) and <code>CLOUDFLARE=1</code> (@marko/run-adapter-cloudflare). See vite.config.ts.</p>
